{"seq":1,"slug":"additive-changes","title":"加性变更策略与无版本演进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-versioning-evolution/strategies/additive-changes","wordCount":1704,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"加性变更策略与无版本演进\">加性变更策略与无版本演进</h1><p>加性变更是 API 演进的黄金路径——在不发布新主版本的前提下持续扩展功能。90% 以上的功能需求可以通过加性变更满足，前提是设计时就为扩展预留空间。本文系统阐述加性变更的设计模式、实施边界、以及&quot;无版本演进&quot;（versionless evolution）的工程实践。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>加性变更的核心概念包括：只添加原则（Only-Add，不修改不删除）、Robustness Principle 依赖（客户端必须忽略未知字段）、Open Enum（可扩展枚举）vs Closed Enum（固定枚举）的区分、以及无版本演进（Versionless Evolution）作为加性变更的极端形式。掌握这些概念是减少破坏性变更发生频率的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"加性变更的核心原则\">加性变更的核心原则</h2><p>加性变更的定义是：<strong>只添加，不修改，不删除</strong>。具体而言：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>只添加可选字段</strong>——新字段对请求是可选的（不提供时使用默认值），对响应是额外的（旧客户端忽略）</li>\n<li><strong>只添加新端点</strong>——现有端点的行为不变</li>\n<li><strong>只添加新枚举值</strong>——已有值的语义不变</li>\n<li><strong>只放宽约束</strong>——从严格变为宽松（必填→可选，非空→可空）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>加性变更之所以安全，依赖一个关键前提：客户端遵守 Robustness Principle。如果客户端对未知字段报错（如 Java Jackson 默认开启 <code>FAIL_ON_UNKNOWN_PROPERTIES</code>），即使是添加响应字段也会导致客户端崩溃。因此，加性变更策略需要配套的客户端指南。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[功能需求] --&gt; B{能否通过加性变更实现?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[设计为可选字段/新端点]&#10;    C --&gt; D[在当前版本内发布]&#10;    D --&gt; E[更新文档 + 次版本号]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| F{能否重新建模为加性?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[重新设计数据模型]&#10;    G --&gt; C&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[标记为破坏性变更]&#10;    H --&gt; I[走新版本发布流程]\">graph TD\n    A[功能需求] --&gt; B{能否通过加性变更实现?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[设计为可选字段/新端点]\n    C --&gt; D[在当前版本内发布]\n    D --&gt; E[更新文档 + 次版本号]\n    B --&gt;|否| F{能否重新建模为加性?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[重新设计数据模型]\n    G --&gt; C\n    F --&gt;|否| H[标记为破坏性变更]\n    H --&gt; I[走新版本发布流程]</pre><h2 id=\"响应体扩展模式\">响应体扩展模式</h2><h3 id=\"字段添加\">字段添加</h3><p>最基础的加性变更——在响应体中新增字段：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// v1 原始响应&#10;{ &quot;id&quot;: &quot;usr_123&quot;, &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Alice&quot; }&#10;&#10;// 加性扩展后（仍是 v1）&#10;{ &quot;id&quot;: &quot;usr_123&quot;, &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Alice&quot;, &quot;email&quot;: &quot;alice@example.com&quot;, &quot;created_at&quot;: &quot;2026-01-15T10:30:00Z&quot; }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// v1 原始响应</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"usr_123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Alice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 加性扩展后（仍是 v1）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"usr_123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Alice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"alice@example.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"created_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-01-15T10:30:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span></code></pre></div><p>旧客户端的 JSON 解析器遇到 <code>email</code> 和 <code>created_at</code> 时直接忽略，不影响已有逻辑。</p>\n<h3 id=\"嵌套对象扩展\">嵌套对象扩展</h3><p>当需要添加结构化信息时，使用嵌套对象避免顶层字段爆炸：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// 加性扩展：添加 metadata 对象&#10;{&#10;  &quot;id&quot;: &quot;usr_123&quot;,&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Alice&quot;,&#10;  &quot;metadata&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;last_login&quot;: &quot;2026-07-01T08:00:00Z&quot;,&#10;    &quot;login_count&quot;: 142&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 加性扩展：添加 metadata 对象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"usr_123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Alice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"metadata\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"last_login\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-07-01T08:00:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"login_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">142</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>设计原则</strong>：新增的嵌套对象应该是独立的信息单元，不改变现有字段的语义或结构。<code>metadata</code> 的存在与否不影响 <code>id</code> 和 <code>name</code> 的含义。</p>\n<h3 id=\"多态响应扩展\">多态响应扩展</h3><p>使用 discriminator 字段实现可扩展的多态响应：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// 原始设计支持两种类型&#10;{ &quot;type&quot;: &quot;individual&quot;, &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Alice&quot;, &quot;ssn&quot;: &quot;***&quot; }&#10;{ &quot;type&quot;: &quot;business&quot;, &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Acme Inc&quot;, &quot;tax_id&quot;: &quot;***&quot; }&#10;&#10;// 加性扩展：新增类型&#10;{ &quot;type&quot;: &quot;government&quot;, &quot;name&quot;: &quot;City Hall&quot;, &quot;jurisdiction&quot;: &quot;municipal&quot; }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 原始设计支持两种类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"individual\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Alice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"ssn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"***\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"business\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Acme Inc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"tax_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"***\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 加性扩展：新增类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"government\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"City Hall\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"jurisdiction\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"municipal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span></code></pre></div><p>客户端应该对 <code>type</code> 字段使用 <code>switch-default</code> 模式，未知类型走通用处理逻辑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"请求体扩展模式\">请求体扩展模式</h2><h3 id=\"可选参数添加\">可选参数添加</h3><p>新增请求参数时，必须确保不提供时的行为与变更前完全一致：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数设计</th>\n<th>默认值策略</th>\n<th>兼容性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>?sort=created_at</code></td>\n<td>不提供时默认 <code>created_at ASC</code></td>\n<td>安全 ✓</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>?include=metadata</code></td>\n<td>不提供时不包含 metadata</td>\n<td>安全 ✓</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>filter[status]=active</code></td>\n<td>不提供时返回全部</td>\n<td>安全 ✓</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>page_size=50</code></td>\n<td>不提供时使用原默认值</td>\n<td>安全 ✓</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>关键约束</strong>：新参数的默认行为必须等同于参数不存在时的旧行为。如果新增 <code>?include_deleted=false</code>，默认值 <code>false</code> 确保旧客户端仍然看不到已删除的记录。</p>\n<h3 id=\"feature-flag-式扩展\">Feature Flag 式扩展</h3><p>对于较大的功能扩展，可以通过请求头中的 feature flag 来启用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"X-Enable-Feature: enhanced-search,batch-operations\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>X-Enable-Feature: enhanced-search,batch-operations</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种模式允许：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>渐进式发布新功能（灰度到部分客户端）</li>\n<li>客户端按需 opt-in，不强制所有人接受变更</li>\n<li>功能稳定后转为默认行为，flag 进入废弃</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"枚举值扩展与防御性编程\">枚举值扩展与防御性编程</h2><p>枚举扩展是加性变更中最容易出错的领域。添加新枚举值在服务端是加性的，但如果客户端对枚举做了穷举匹配（exhaustive match），新值会触发运行时错误。</p>\n<p><strong>服务端契约</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>枚举只增不减——发布过的值永不删除</li>\n<li>新枚举值的文档明确标注添加日期</li>\n<li>枚举在 API 文档中标记为 &quot;open enum&quot;（可扩展）或 &quot;closed enum&quot;（固定）</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>客户端防御</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"// 防御性枚举处理伪代码&#10;switch (order.status) {&#10;  case &quot;PENDING&quot;:  handlePending(); break;&#10;  case &quot;PAID&quot;:     handlePaid(); break;&#10;  case &quot;SHIPPED&quot;:  handleShipped(); break;&#10;  default:         handleUnknown(order.status); break;  // 必须有&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 防御性枚举处理伪代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>switch (order.status) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  case \"PENDING\":  handlePending(); break;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  case \"PAID\":     handlePaid(); break;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  case \"SHIPPED\":  handleShipped(); break;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  default:         handleUnknown(order.status); break;  // 必须有</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Open Enum 与 Closed Enum 的区分</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>枚举类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>客户端期望</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Open Enum</td>\n<td>值集合可能在未来扩展</td>\n<td>必须处理未知值</td>\n<td>状态码、类型标识、分类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Closed Enum</td>\n<td>值集合是固定的</td>\n<td>可以穷举匹配</td>\n<td>布尔型选择、物理常量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>API 文档应明确标注每个枚举是 open 还是 closed。未标注的默认视为 open。</p>\n<h2 id=\"无版本演进-versionless-evolution\">无版本演进（Versionless Evolution）</h2><p>&quot;无版本演进&quot;不是没有版本号，而是通过严格的加性变更纪律，使得主版本号极少甚至从不递增。API 始终是 <code>/v1</code>，但功能持续扩展。</p>\n<p>这种模式的极端形式是 GraphQL 的设计哲学：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[发布 Schema v1] --&gt; B[添加字段 + @deprecated 旧字段]&#10;    B --&gt; C[客户端按需使用新字段]&#10;    C --&gt; D[监控旧字段使用率]&#10;    D --&gt; E{使用率降至 0?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[安全移除旧字段]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[继续保留]&#10;    G --&gt; D\">graph LR\n    A[发布 Schema v1] --&gt; B[添加字段 + @deprecated 旧字段]\n    B --&gt; C[客户端按需使用新字段]\n    C --&gt; D[监控旧字段使用率]\n    D --&gt; E{使用率降至 0?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[安全移除旧字段]\n    E --&gt;|否| G[继续保留]\n    G --&gt; D</pre><p>无版本演进的前提条件：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>严格的加性变更纪律</strong>——团队必须有足够的技术纪律，任何破坏性变更都被拦截</li>\n<li><strong>强契约测试</strong>——CI 流水线中有消费者契约测试，自动检测兼容性</li>\n<li><strong>客户端可控或有强指南</strong>——消费者遵守 Robustness Principle</li>\n<li><strong>字段级废弃机制</strong>——能精确追踪哪些字段仍被使用</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>适用场景评估</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Score_{versionless} = W_{discipline} \\times S_{contract} \\times S_{client} \\times S_{monitoring}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cor</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ess</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">sc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ni</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中每个因子取 0-1 分。当综合分数 &gt; 0.7 时，无版本演进是可行的。低于此阈值时，显式版本化更安全。</p>\n<h2 id=\"加性变更的反模式\">加性变更的反模式</h2><p>即使遵循&quot;只添加&quot;原则，以下做法仍然会导致问题：</p>\n<p><strong>反模式 1：默认值改变行为</strong>。新增 <code>?include_drafts=true</code> 且默认值为 <code>true</code>——旧客户端突然看到草稿内容。默认值必须保持旧行为。</p>\n<p><strong>反模式 2：加字段改变分页总数</strong>。新增的 <code>total_count</code> 字段如果影响了响应体大小，可能超过某些客户端的缓冲区限制。</p>\n<p><strong>反模式 3：条件性破坏</strong>。新增可选字段 <code>format=xml</code>，当提供时改变整个响应格式。虽然旧客户端不会触发，但新字段的存在本身改变了 API 的行为空间。</p>\n<p><strong>反模式 4：隐式语义依赖</strong>。新增 <code>computed_score</code> 字段，其值依赖于其他现有字段的组合——如果其他字段语义微调，<code>computed_score</code> 的含义也会漂移。</p>\n<p>正确的加性变更应该是自包含的：新字段的语义不依赖于其他字段的未来变化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>加性变更是 API 演进的默认路径——覆盖 90% 以上的功能迭代需求，且无需发布新主版本。成功的关键在于三个配套条件：API 设计时预留扩展空间（可选字段、Open Enum、Feature Flag）、客户端遵守 Robustness Principle（忽略未知字段）、以及严格避免反模式（默认值改变行为、条件性破坏）。当团队的技术纪律足够强时，甚至可以追求无版本演进——主版本号永远停留在 v1。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>延伸阅读</strong>：当加性变更无法满足需求、旧版本需要退出时，如何通过结构化流程安全地废弃和关闭旧版本——详见 <a href=\"deprecation-sunset\">废弃与日落流程</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"加性变更策略与无版本演进","id":"加性变更策略与无版本演进"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"加性变更的核心原则","id":"加性变更的核心原则"},{"level":2,"text":"响应体扩展模式","id":"响应体扩展模式"},{"level":3,"text":"字段添加","id":"字段添加"},{"level":3,"text":"嵌套对象扩展","id":"嵌套对象扩展"},{"level":3,"text":"多态响应扩展","id":"多态响应扩展"},{"level":2,"text":"请求体扩展模式","id":"请求体扩展模式"},{"level":3,"text":"可选参数添加","id":"可选参数添加"},{"level":3,"text":"Feature Flag 式扩展","id":"feature-flag-式扩展"},{"level":2,"text":"枚举值扩展与防御性编程","id":"枚举值扩展与防御性编程"},{"level":2,"text":"无版本演进（Versionless Evolution）","id":"无版本演进-versionless-evolution"},{"level":2,"text":"加性变更的反模式","id":"加性变更的反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"兼容性契约与变更分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-versioning-evolution/foundations/compatibility-contracts"},"next":{"title":"废弃与日落流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-versioning-evolution/strategies/deprecation-sunset"}}